# Follow-up for SQ-HR-05 on r11w2: the wild-crops log never names rules; check the biome tag, a direct placement,
# and a larger forest count (y 40 to 200).
pace 2
## SQ-HR-05b | raspberry wild-crop tag, feature places, bushes in a 256 x 256 forest square
> zq biometag creativedelight:wild_crops/raspberry
expect biometag creativedelight:wild_crops/raspberry
> tp qa -272 160 -46
> forceload add -384 -160 -129 95
sleep 60
> zq count -384 40 -160 -129 200 95 hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush
> execute positioned -272 100 -46 run place feature creativedelight:wild/raspberry_bush
> zq count -290 40 -64 -254 200 -28 hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush
> forceload remove all
look tag has about 26 biomes incl. minecraft:forest; natural count over 256 chunks (expect a few patches at 1 in 62); `place feature` succeeds and the second count > 0
